  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One rule",
      "items": [
        "Nothing on the laptop imports graphiti or a DB driver — every surface goes through the API over HTTP",
        "The engine listens on loopback only; the API is the sole public port",
        "The API mints a short-lived HS256 principal; the engine trusts nothing else"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Where things live",
      "items": [
        "Postgres: users, orgs, projects, memberships, memory index, skills catalogue, audit, chats",
        "Neo4j: the text of every memory, entities and facts — one group per org × project × (team | person)",
        "Skill content: on the server. Git carries code only. Ollama runs on the host, outside compose."
      ]
    }
  ]
